WEBVTT

00:09.143 --> 00:10.411
ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.444 --> 00:12.446
Kids:
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：
是的，是的，队长！

00:12.480 --> 00:13.814
I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.847 --> 00:15.516
( louder ):
AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
（大声）：
是的，是的，队长！

00:15.549 --> 00:18.719
* OH...
* 哦...

00:18.752 --> 00:20.788
* WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:20.821 --> 00:22.790
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:22.823 --> 00:25.293
* ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE. *
* 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 *

00:25.326 --> 00:26.694
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:26.727 --> 00:29.097
* IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE BE
SOMETHING YOU WISH... *
*如果航海废话是
您想要的东西... *

00:29.130 --> 00:30.364
* SPONGEBOB SQUARE PANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝方形裤子！ *

00:30.398 --> 00:33.134
* THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH. *
* 然后掉到甲板上
像鱼一样扑通扑通。 *

00:33.167 --> 00:34.768
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 海绵宝宝！ *

00:34.802 --> 00:36.704
* READY?
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS! *
* 准备好？
海绵宝宝！ *

00:36.737 --> 00:39.707
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:39.740 --> 00:40.741
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:40.774 --> 00:43.377
* SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
* 海绵宝宝！

00:43.411 --> 00:45.713
( laughs heartily )
（会心地笑）

00:45.746 --> 00:49.217
[Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
( plays airy tune )
[字幕由THE赞助
美国教育部
（演奏轻快的曲调）

00:49.250 --> 00:50.718
and NICKELODEON]
和尼克频道]

01:01.695 --> 01:02.630
HEY, SANDY!
嘿，桑迪！

01:02.663 --> 01:03.697
HEY, SANDY!
嘿，桑迪！

01:03.731 --> 01:04.732
HEY, SANDY.
嘿，桑迪。

01:06.534 --> 01:09.837
( loud whirring )
（大声呼呼）

01:12.506 --> 01:13.707
WOW!
哇！

01:16.344 --> 01:17.411
HOWDY, SPONGEBOB!
你好，海绵宝宝！

01:17.445 --> 01:18.479
HOW DO YOU LIKE IT?
你喜欢吗？

01:18.512 --> 01:19.513
WHAT IS IT?
它是什么？

01:19.547 --> 01:21.415
IT'S A ROCKET SHIP, DUH!
这是一艘火箭飞船，呃！

01:21.449 --> 01:23.684
I'LL MEET YOU DOWNSTAIRS
AND SHOW YOU AROUND.
我在楼下等你
带您四处参观。

01:25.319 --> 01:27.255
WOW! WHAT ARE YOU
GOING TO DO WITH IT?
哇！你是什么？
打算用它做什么？

01:27.288 --> 01:29.390
I'M GOING TO THE MOON,
SPONGEBOB.
我要去月球，
海绵宝宝。

01:29.423 --> 01:30.391
THE MOON!
月亮！

01:30.424 --> 01:31.392
CAN I GO?
我可以走了吗？

01:31.425 --> 01:33.327
NO WAY,
SPONGEBOB
没办法，
海绵宝宝

01:33.361 --> 01:35.563
ESPECIALLY AFTER
YOUR LITTLE MISHAP
特别是之后
你的小不幸

01:35.596 --> 01:37.131
WITH MY WHIRLYBIRD.
和我的飞鸟。

01:37.165 --> 01:39.333
BESIDES, THERE'S
NOT ENOUGH ROOM
FOR YOU.
除此之外，还有
空间不足
为了您。

01:39.367 --> 01:41.535
BUT I DON'T TAKE UP
THAT MUCH SPACE.
但我不接受
这么大的空间。

01:41.569 --> 01:42.670
SEE?
看？

01:43.937 --> 01:45.906
I CAN FIT IN HERE.
我可以适应这里。

01:45.939 --> 01:47.475
MMM... COZY.
嗯...舒适。

01:47.508 --> 01:49.443
I NEED THAT DRAWER.
我需要那个抽屉。

01:49.477 --> 01:54.315
WELL, HOW ABOUT THIS,
OR THIS, OR THIS?
嗯，这个怎么样，
还是这个，还是这个？

01:54.348 --> 01:55.516
SPONGEBOB
海绵宝宝

01:55.549 --> 01:57.451
THIS ISN'T FOR FUN-- SEE THIS?
这不是为了好玩——看到这个了吗？

01:57.485 --> 01:58.319
THIS IS SCIENCE.
这就是科学。

01:58.352 --> 02:00.421
I DON'T HAVE TIME
FOR FUN AND GAMES
我没有时间
为了乐趣和游戏

02:00.454 --> 02:02.256
AND I DON'T HAVE TIME
FOR STOWAWAYS.
我没有时间
对于偷渡者。

02:02.290 --> 02:03.491
FINE.
美好的。

02:03.524 --> 02:04.925
PUT ME IN THE BRIG.
把我放进双桅船。

02:04.958 --> 02:06.327
I DON'T MIND.
我不介意。

02:06.360 --> 02:09.363
THAT'S THE AIR BED,
SPONGEBOB.
这就是气垫床，
海绵宝宝。

02:09.397 --> 02:11.165
I NEED THAT, TOO.
我也需要那个。

02:11.199 --> 02:12.500
OH, PLEASE, CAN I GO?
哦，请问，我可以走了吗？

02:12.533 --> 02:14.202
CAN I, CAN I, HUH, PLEASE?
我可以吗，我可以吗，嗯，请问吗？

02:14.235 --> 02:17.471
ALL RIGHT, Y'ALL CAN RIDE
IN THE CARGO HOLD
好吧，你们都可以骑了
在货舱中

02:17.505 --> 02:18.839
IF YOU JUST...
如果你只是...

02:18.872 --> 02:20.174
YEAH!
是的！

02:20.208 --> 02:21.842
GOING TO THE MOON!
去月球！

02:21.875 --> 02:24.912
MOONRIDE, MOONRIDE, MOONRIDE!
月游，月游，月游！

02:24.945 --> 02:28.282
BUT THIS TIME, JUST DON'T
TOUCH ANYTHING, OKAY?
但这一次，只是不要
触摸任何东西，好吗？

02:28.316 --> 02:30.318
WOW! LOOK AT
THAT POPGUN.
哇！看看
那把弹枪。

02:30.351 --> 02:32.486
WILL WE HUNT ALIENS
ON THE MOON?
我们会猎杀外星人吗
在月球上？

02:32.520 --> 02:33.921
OH, HUSH, SILLY.
哦，嘘，傻瓜。

02:35.523 --> 02:37.525
THIS IS FOR
HARVESTING
MOON ROCKS.
这是为了
收获
月球岩石。

02:37.558 --> 02:39.427
WHEN YOU'RE DONE
PLAYING WITH ROCKS
当你完成后
玩石头

02:39.460 --> 02:40.561
YOU COULD USE THAT
你可以用它

02:40.594 --> 02:42.430
FOR SOME SERIOUS
ALIEN HUNTING.
对于一些严肃的
外星人狩猎。

02:42.463 --> 02:44.332
ALIENS?
ARE YOU NUTS?
外星人？
你疯了吗？

02:44.365 --> 02:45.699
I'VE BEEN TO THE MOON.
我去过月球。

02:45.733 --> 02:47.335
THERE ARE NO ALIENS.
没有外星人。

02:47.368 --> 02:49.770
SANDY, SANDY, SANDY.
桑迪，桑迪，桑迪。

02:49.803 --> 02:52.206
HOW CAN YOU BE SO NAIVE?
你怎么能这么天真？

02:52.240 --> 02:53.774
THERE'S EVIDENCE
ALL AROUND US.
有证据
就在我们周围。

02:53.807 --> 02:57.478
HOW DO YOU EXPLAIN
ATLANTIS, COWLICKS,
99-CENT STORES?
你怎么解释
亚特兰蒂斯、考利克斯、
99分店？

02:57.511 --> 02:59.513
AND HOW ABOUT THOSE
MYSTERIOUS CIRCLES
那些怎么样？
神秘的圆圈

02:59.547 --> 03:01.482
THAT POP UP IN
KELP FIELDS OVERNIGHT?
弹出的
海带田过夜？

03:01.515 --> 03:02.616
AAH! THERE'S ONE NOW.
啊啊！现在有一个了。

03:02.650 --> 03:04.718
SPONGEBOB, YOU
DON'T KNOW A THING
海绵宝宝，你
什么都不知道

03:04.752 --> 03:05.919
ABOUT OUTER SPACE.
关于外太空。

03:05.953 --> 03:07.688
NOW, GO HOME AND
GET SOME SHUTEYE.
现在，回家吧
闭上眼睛。

03:07.721 --> 03:09.723
BE HERE TOMORROW
AT THE CRACK OF DAWN
明天就到这里
黎明时分

03:09.757 --> 03:13.261
AND LEAVE YOUR CRAZY
ALIEN NOTIONS BEHIND.
并离开你的疯狂
背后的外星人观念。

03:13.294 --> 03:16.964
( snoring )
（打鼾）

03:16.997 --> 03:18.799
( alarm clock ticking loudly )
（闹钟滴答作响）

03:26.640 --> 03:29.643
OH, HURRY UP!
哦，快点！

03:29.677 --> 03:31.545
THIS OUGHT TO DO THE TRICK.
这应该可以解决问题。

03:33.046 --> 03:35.449
Patrick:
HIYA,
SPONGEBOB.
帕特里克：
嗨，
海绵宝宝。

03:35.483 --> 03:36.684
WHAT IS IT, PATRICK?
这是什么，帕特里克？

03:36.717 --> 03:38.619
CAN'T YOU SEE
I'M SLEEPING HERE?
你看不到吗
我睡在这里？

03:38.652 --> 03:41.689
WELL, I KNOW YOU'RE GOING
ON THAT MOON TRIP TOMORROW
好吧，我知道你要走了
明天的月球旅行

03:41.722 --> 03:44.292
AND I JUST WANTED
TO BRING YOU SOMETHING.
我只是想要
给你带来一些东西。

03:44.325 --> 03:45.559
A PRESENT?
礼物？

03:45.593 --> 03:46.760
NO.
不。

03:46.794 --> 03:48.696
UH... SPONGEBOB?
呃……海绵宝宝？

03:48.729 --> 03:51.765
IS SANDY'S ROCKET ALIEN-PROOF?
桑迪的火箭能防外星人吗？

03:51.799 --> 03:53.867
THERE ARE NO ALIENS, PATRICK.
没有外星人，帕特里克。

03:53.901 --> 03:55.403
JUST ASK SANDY.
问问桑迪就知道了。

03:55.436 --> 03:57.671
WELL, I GUESS YOU
WON'T BE NEEDING
好吧，我猜你
不需要

03:57.705 --> 04:00.441
THIS ALIEN REPELLENT
FOR YOUR TRIP.
这个外星人驱虫剂
为了您的旅行。

04:00.474 --> 04:02.410
ALIEN REPELLENT?
LET ME SEE THAT.
外星人排斥剂？
让我看看。

04:02.443 --> 04:04.712
"NEW ALIEN-OUT!
WINDOW PROTECTANT.
“新的外星人！
窗户保护剂。

04:04.745 --> 04:06.580
DOES NOT STOP BURGLARS."
并不能阻止窃贼。”

04:06.614 --> 04:08.449
WELL, I GUESS
YOU'RE RIGHT, PATRICK.
嗯，我猜
你是对的，帕特里克。

04:08.482 --> 04:10.751
WE BETTER GO SPRAY
THOSE WINDOWS.
我们最好去喷洒
那些窗户。

04:10.784 --> 04:14.355
Patrick:
LOOK HOW BIG IT IS, SPONGEBOB!
帕特里克：
看看它有多大，海绵宝宝！

04:14.388 --> 04:16.056
IT'S PRETTY
IMPRESSIVE, ALL RIGHT.
很漂亮
令人印象深刻，好吧。

04:16.089 --> 04:17.358
COME ON!
快点！

04:17.391 --> 04:19.460
WE'RE JUST HERE
TO SPRAY THE WINDOWS
我们就在这里
喷洒窗户

04:19.493 --> 04:20.494
PATRICK.
帕特里克。

04:20.528 --> 04:21.662
WOW...
哇...

04:21.695 --> 04:23.331
HOW DO YOU THINK
WE GET INSIDE?
你觉得怎么样
我们进去吗？

04:23.364 --> 04:24.532
WE DON'T.
我们不。

04:24.565 --> 04:26.567
WE'RE JUST
SPRAYING THE...
我们只是
喷涂...

04:26.600 --> 04:27.568
WINDOWS.
视窗。

04:27.601 --> 04:29.803
I OPENED IT, SPONGEBOB!
我打开了它，海绵宝宝！

04:29.837 --> 04:30.871
COME ON!
快点！

04:33.073 --> 04:35.909
HOLY SEA COW,
SPONGEBOB.
圣海牛，
海绵宝宝。

04:35.943 --> 04:39.580
THIS MUST BE
THE CONTROL ROOM.
这必须是
控制室。

04:39.613 --> 04:41.949
YEAH, JUST DON'T
TOUCH ANYTHING.
是的，只是不要
触摸任何东西。

04:41.982 --> 04:43.551
LOOK, I'M WINNING!
看，我赢了！

04:43.584 --> 04:45.419
PATRICK,
CUT THAT OUT.
帕特里克，
把它删掉。

04:45.453 --> 04:46.854
PATRICK,
COME ON.
帕特里克，
来吧。

04:46.887 --> 04:49.490
WE CAN'T HANG
AROUND IN HERE.
我们不能挂
就在这里。

04:49.523 --> 04:51.725
THIS IS SANDY'S
BIG ROCKET
这是桑迪的
大火箭

04:51.759 --> 04:53.461
NOT SOME KIND OF FUN... HOUSE.
不是某种有趣的……房子。

04:54.562 --> 04:55.529
WHOO!
哇！

04:55.563 --> 04:56.730
WINNER.
优胜者。

04:56.764 --> 04:58.666
YEAH, HIGH SCORE!
是的，高分！

04:58.699 --> 05:00.434
WHAT GAME WAS
THAT, ANYWAY?
什么游戏是
那，无论如何？

05:00.468 --> 05:02.770
I DON'T KNOW,
BUT LET'S SEE
WHAT THIS DOES.
我不知道，
但让我们看看
这是做什么的。

05:02.803 --> 05:04.972
PATRICK, I DON'T
THINK WE SHOULD...
帕特里克，我不
认为我们应该...

05:06.374 --> 05:07.375
I LIKE ROCKETS.
我喜欢火箭。

05:09.677 --> 05:10.811
MORE, MORE!
更多，更多！

05:10.844 --> 05:12.580
NO MORE.
不再。

05:18.986 --> 05:20.954
OKAY, ONE MORE.
好的，再来一张。

05:24.558 --> 05:25.826
OKAY, THAT'S
ENOUGH.
好的，就是这样
够了。

05:25.859 --> 05:26.994
LET'S GO.
我们走吧。

05:27.027 --> 05:29.663
WAIT, I THINK
THIS ONE STARTS IT.
等等，我想
从这个开始。

05:29.697 --> 05:31.532
PATRICK, WHAT
ARE YOU DOING?
帕特里克，什么
你在做什么吗？

05:31.565 --> 05:32.966
I'M THE SPACE
TRAVELER HERE
我就是空间
旅行者在这里

05:33.000 --> 05:35.836
AND I HAPPEN
TO KNOW THAT THAT
PARTICULAR BUTTON
我发生了
知道那
特殊按钮

05:35.869 --> 05:37.405
IS RIGHT OVER HERE.
就在这里。

05:37.438 --> 05:38.739
( engine roaring )
（发动机轰鸣）

05:38.772 --> 05:40.808
WE'VE STARTED
THE ROCKET!
我们已经开始了
火箭！

05:40.841 --> 05:42.576
( sirens blaring )
（警笛鸣响）

05:42.610 --> 05:45.779
OH, SPONGEBOB.
哦，海绵宝宝。

05:45.813 --> 05:48.416
( sirens wailing )
（警笛鸣响）

05:48.449 --> 05:51.118
( screaming )
（尖叫）

05:55.856 --> 05:57.758
HANG ON, BUDDY!
坚持住，伙计！

06:02.095 --> 06:04.465
HEY, WE STOPPED
FALLING.
嘿，我们停了
坠落。

06:04.498 --> 06:06.667
LOOK, WE'RE IN SPACE NOW!
看，我们现在在太空了！

06:06.700 --> 06:07.901
WHEE!
哇！

06:07.935 --> 06:11.004
( moaning dizzily )
（头晕地呻吟）

06:11.038 --> 06:13.607
HEY, SOMEBODY
GET ME DOWN
嘿，有人
让我下来

06:13.641 --> 06:15.543
OR UP, OR
SOMETHING.
或向上，或
有什么东西。

06:15.576 --> 06:16.877
( laughing )
（笑）

06:18.912 --> 06:21.181
HEY, SPONGEBOB,
WATCH THIS.
嘿，海绵宝宝，
注意这个。

06:21.214 --> 06:23.751
HEY, YOU GOT
YOUR TOOTHPASTE
嘿，你有
你的牙膏

06:23.784 --> 06:25.553
IN MY PEANUT BUTTER.
在我的花生酱里。

06:25.586 --> 06:26.954
( laughing )
（笑）

06:31.024 --> 06:33.461
PATRICK,
I CAN DO THIS.
帕特里克，
我能做到。

06:37.831 --> 06:40.634
HEY, WHO TURNED
THE HEAVY BACK ON?
嘿，谁转身了
重磅回归？

06:40.668 --> 06:42.470
WE MUST BE LANDING.
我们一定要着陆了。

06:42.503 --> 06:44.137
ALL RIGHT.
好的。

06:44.171 --> 06:48.175
SOMETIMES THAT SPONGEBOB IS
AS DUMB AS A SACK OF PEANUTS.
有时海绵宝宝是
像一袋花生一样愚蠢。

06:53.847 --> 06:55.148
( squeaking )
（吱吱声）

06:58.185 --> 07:02.556
OH, IT SURE LOOKS
A LOT LIKE HOME.
哦，看起来确实如此
很像家。

07:04.625 --> 07:06.960
HEY, LOOK, IT'S GARY.
嘿，看，这是加里。

07:06.994 --> 07:09.730
COME HERE,
GARY, GARY.
来这里，
加里，加里。

07:09.763 --> 07:11.599
WAIT! DON'T GO
NEAR HIM, PATRICK.
等待！不要走
在他附近，帕特里克。

07:11.632 --> 07:13.601
CAN'T YOU SEE THIS
IS ALL A TRICK?
你看不到这个吗
都是骗局吗？

07:13.634 --> 07:15.603
THE ALIENS
ARE PROJECTING
OUR MEMORIES
外星人
正在预测
我们的回忆

07:15.636 --> 07:16.704
ONTO THE
ENVIRONMENT.
到
环境。

07:16.737 --> 07:17.871
THEY'RE TRYING
TO CONFUSE US.
他们正在尝试
迷惑我们。

07:17.905 --> 07:20.841
SO YOU MEAN TO SAY
THEY'VE TAKEN WHAT
WE THOUGHT WE THINK
所以你想说
他们拿走了什么
我们以为我们以为

07:20.874 --> 07:22.242
AND MAKE US
THINK WE THOUGHT
并让我们
认为我们认为

07:22.275 --> 07:23.811
OUR THOUGHTS
WE'VE BEEN THINKING
我们的想法
我们一直在思考

07:23.844 --> 07:26.113
ARE THOUGHTS WE THINK
WE THOUGHT?... WE THINK?
我们的想法是什么
我们认为？...我们认为？

07:26.146 --> 07:28.882
OKAY, BUT I'M NOT
GOING TO FALL FOR IT.
好吧，但我不是
会爱上它。

07:28.916 --> 07:30.618
( meows )
（喵）

07:30.651 --> 07:31.652
YEAH!
是的！

07:31.685 --> 07:33.854
YOU GOT HIM,
SPONGEBOB.
你得到了他，
海绵宝宝。

07:33.887 --> 07:35.756
WON'T SANDY BE PROUD?
桑迪不会感到自豪吗？

07:35.789 --> 07:37.491
SANDY... I FORGOT
ALL ABOUT HER.
桑迪……我忘了
关于她的一切。

07:37.525 --> 07:39.993
OH, SHE'S GOING
TO HATE US FOR
STEALING HER ROCKET
哦，她要走了
恨我们
偷走她的火箭

07:40.027 --> 07:41.562
BUT WON'T SHE FEEL SILLY
但她不会觉得自己很傻吗

07:41.595 --> 07:43.797
WHEN I BRING HER BACK
A REAL, LIVE ALIEN?
当我带她回来时
一个真正的、活生生的外星人？

07:43.831 --> 07:44.665
OH, SHE'LL LOVE ME.
哦，她会爱我的。

07:44.698 --> 07:47.968
COME ON, PATRICK,
THE MORE THE MERRIER.
来吧，帕特里克，
越多越好。

07:48.001 --> 07:49.136
( bell rings )
（铃声响起）

07:49.169 --> 07:51.271
ALIEN HUNTING,
ALIEN HUNTING!
外星人狩猎，
狩猎外星人！

07:51.304 --> 07:54.742
SHH, PATRICK, DON'T LET THEM
KNOW WE'RE ON TO THEM.
嘘，帕特里克，别让他们
知道我们正在关注他们。

07:54.775 --> 07:57.945
( artificially ):
UH... YEAH,
ALIEN HUNTING--
（人为地）：
呃...是的，
狩猎外星人——

07:57.978 --> 07:59.780
I SAW THAT
ON TV, TOO.
我看到了
电视上也有。

07:59.813 --> 08:01.582
GEE, PATRICK,
LET'S DROP IN
哎呀，帕特里克，
我们来吧

08:01.615 --> 08:03.551
ON OUR OLD PAL
SQUIDWARD
关于我们的老朋友
章鱼哥

08:03.584 --> 08:05.185
AND SEE WHAT
HE'S UP TO.
看看会发生什么
他可以做到。

08:05.218 --> 08:07.755
( quietly ):
MAKE SURE YOUR
GUN IS PUMPED.
（静静地）：
确保您的
枪已上气。

08:07.788 --> 08:12.893
( snoring )
（打鼾）

08:12.926 --> 08:14.094
LOOK AT IT, PATRICK.
看看它，帕特里克。

08:14.127 --> 08:16.196
IT'S DISGUSTING.
那真令人恶心。

08:16.229 --> 08:18.065
( snoring )
（打鼾）

08:19.800 --> 08:21.134
( mutters ):
MMM... GRANDMA.
（嘀咕）：
嗯……奶奶。

08:26.273 --> 08:28.075
IT'S EVEN UGLIER
UP CLOSE.
更难看
近距离观察。

08:28.108 --> 08:29.877
LET'S BEGIN
THE ANALYSIS.
让我们开始吧
分析。

08:33.180 --> 08:35.282
WAIT...
WHAT'S THAT?
等等...
那是什么？

08:38.085 --> 08:40.821
I THINK I'M GOING
TO BE SICK.
我想我要走了
生病了。

08:40.854 --> 08:44.658
PATRICK, DO YOU KNOW
WHAT THIS THING IS?
帕特里克，你知道吗
这东西是什么？

08:44.692 --> 08:45.793
STINKY.
臭。

08:45.826 --> 08:47.294
NO... IT'S
AN EGG SAC.
不……是的
一个卵囊。

08:47.327 --> 08:49.296
LET'S LOOK
AT THE EMBRYO.
让我们看看
在胚胎时期。

08:51.632 --> 08:53.934
TWINS.
TWINS.
双胞胎。
双胞胎。

08:53.967 --> 08:54.868
( mumbling )
（咕哝）

08:57.304 --> 09:00.774
PARDON MY FRENCH, BUT
GET THIS THING OFF ME!
请原谅我的法语，但是
把这个东西从我身上拿开！

09:03.110 --> 09:05.178
( screaming )
（尖叫）

09:08.649 --> 09:11.018
PATRICK AND SPONGEBOB,
GET OUT OF MY BEDROOM
帕特里克和海绵宝宝，
离开我的卧室

09:11.051 --> 09:12.886
AND GIVE ME BACK MY TENTACLES.
把我的触手还给我。

09:12.920 --> 09:13.921
IT'S AWAKE!
它醒了！

09:13.954 --> 09:15.956
LET'S CAPTURE
THE LITTLE PHONY.
让我们捕捉
小骗子。

09:15.989 --> 09:17.925
OH, GET AWAY FROM ME.
哦，离我远点。

09:17.958 --> 09:19.860
( yelling )
（大喊）

09:22.763 --> 09:25.733
( yelling and noise inside )
（里面有叫喊声和噪音）

09:29.002 --> 09:31.004
AHOY, THERE, LADS.
嘿，好了，小伙子们。

09:31.038 --> 09:33.807
UP A BIT LATE TO
BE PLAYING PIRATE,
AREN'T YE?
有点晚了
扮演海盗，
不是吗？

09:33.841 --> 09:35.208
( laughing )
（笑）

09:35.242 --> 09:36.276
( gasps )
（喘气）

09:36.309 --> 09:37.878
WAIT, DON'T SHOOT.
等等，别开枪。

09:37.911 --> 09:41.281
OKAY, OKAY, SHOOT ME,
BUT DON'T TAKE ME MONEY.
好吧，好吧，开枪打我，
但别拿我的钱。

09:41.314 --> 09:44.151
WE DON'T WANT YOUR
MONEY, MOON MAN.
我们不想要你的
钱，月球人。

09:48.221 --> 09:52.259
LOOK AT THEM
SQUIRMING AROUND
IN THERE.
看看他们
蠕动
在那里。

09:52.292 --> 09:53.827
OOH... GROSS.
哦……恶心。

09:53.861 --> 09:56.163
PLENTY MORE WHERE
THOSE CAME FROM.
还有更多地方
那些来自。

09:58.165 --> 09:59.767
SHH...
嘘……

10:01.969 --> 10:05.338
SPONGEBOB, WHAT ARE
YOU DOING HERE SO LATE?
海绵宝宝，是什么
你这么晚了还在这儿吗？

10:05.372 --> 10:06.740
WHATEVER THIS IS
不管这是什么

10:06.774 --> 10:11.144
( in deep voice ):
IT'S GOING ON YOUR
PERMANENT RECORD.
（低沉的声音）：
一切都在你的身上
永久记录。

10:17.918 --> 10:19.052
( moaning and whining )
（呻吟和哀嚎）

10:19.086 --> 10:20.754
THIS IS RIDICULOUS!
这太荒谬了！

10:20.788 --> 10:23.156
PLEASE LET ME
OUT OF HERE!
请让我
离开这里！

10:23.190 --> 10:24.224
OUCH! OW!
哎哟！噢！

10:24.257 --> 10:25.993
( captives all squawking )
（俘虏们都在尖叫）

10:26.026 --> 10:26.794
SPONGEBOB, I THINK
我认为是海绵宝宝

10:26.827 --> 10:29.129
WE MIGHT HAVE TO MAKE
A SECOND TRIP.
我们可能必须做
第二次旅行。

10:29.162 --> 10:31.899
THERE'S NO TIME FOR THAT--
JUST PUSH HARDER.
没时间这么做了——
再努力一点。

10:31.932 --> 10:34.101
Sandy:
SPONGEBOB, WHAT
ARE Y'ALL DOING?
桑迪：
海绵宝宝，什么
你们都在做什么吗？

10:34.134 --> 10:36.403
I CAN'T TURN MY BACK
ON YOU FOR TWO SECONDS
我无法回头
关注你两秒钟

10:36.436 --> 10:39.006
WITHOUT YOU
CAUSING A WHOLE
MESS OF TROUBLE.
没有你
造成整体
混乱的麻烦。

10:39.039 --> 10:40.207
LOOK AT YOU,
BAGGING UP
看看你，
收拾行李

10:40.240 --> 10:41.809
YOUR FRIENDS
AND NEIGHBORS
你的朋友
和邻居

10:41.842 --> 10:43.677
JUST LIKE THEY WAS A FRESH CROP
就像新鲜作物一样

10:43.711 --> 10:45.112
OF HICKORY-SMOKED SAUSAGES.
山核桃熏香肠。

10:45.145 --> 10:47.948
YOU DONE TURNED
MY LITTLE SCIENCE
EXPERIMENT
你已经转身了
我的小科学
实验

10:47.981 --> 10:49.216
INTO A DISASTER.
陷入灾难。

10:49.249 --> 10:51.785
YOU TWO OUGHT
TO BE ASHAMED
OF YOURSELF.
你们两个应该
感到羞耻
你自己。

10:51.819 --> 10:53.854
NICE TRY... SANDY.
不错的尝试...桑迪。

10:53.887 --> 10:57.925
OR SHOULD I SAY,
MISS ALIEN PANTS?
或者我应该说，
外星人裤子小姐？

10:57.958 --> 10:59.226
( laughing )
（笑）

10:59.259 --> 11:00.293
ALIENS?!
外星人？！

11:00.327 --> 11:02.062
IS THAT WHAT
THIS IS ABOUT?
就是这样吗
这是关于？

11:02.095 --> 11:03.363
THIS ISN'T THE MOON.
这不是月球。

11:03.396 --> 11:05.365
WE'RE STILL
IN BIKINI BO...
我们仍然
穿着比基尼泳装...

11:06.967 --> 11:08.135
JUST GOES
TO SHOW YOU
就这样
向您展示

11:08.168 --> 11:09.737
YOU CAN'T
TRUST ANYONE.
你不能
相信任何人。

11:12.439 --> 11:15.843
SO... YOU WERE
AN ALIEN ALL THE TIME
所以...你是
一直都是外星人

11:15.876 --> 11:17.745
AND YOU DIDN'T
EVEN TELL ME.
而你没有
甚至告诉我。

11:17.778 --> 11:19.046
I DIDN'T EVEN KNOW.
我什至不知道。

11:19.079 --> 11:21.081
YEAH? WELL, I GOT YOU NOW.
是的？好吧，我现在找到你了。

11:21.114 --> 11:25.152
OH, BUT IT'S NOT YOU
THAT'S GOT ME; IT'S...
哦，但这不是你
这就是我的目标；它是...

11:25.185 --> 11:26.153
( popgun pops )
（流行枪流行）

11:26.186 --> 11:28.421
ME THAT'S GOT ME.
我就是我。

11:30.357 --> 11:33.827
BOY, I CAN'T WAIT TO SEE
THE LOOK ON SANDY'S FACE.
男孩，我迫不及待地想看
桑迪脸上的表情。

11:36.163 --> 11:38.231
( motor conks out )
（电机故障）

11:38.265 --> 11:40.167
SANDY, I'M BACK.
桑迪，我回来了。

11:40.200 --> 11:41.869
WOW!
哇！

11:41.902 --> 11:44.404
BIKINI BOTTOM SURE
LOOKS DIFFERENT.
比基尼下装确定
看起来不一样。

11:45.873 --> 11:47.140
UH-OH.
呃-哦。

11:47.174 --> 11:48.809
Captives:
SPONGEBOB...
俘虏：
海绵宝宝...

11:48.842 --> 11:52.012
WE "ALIENS" WOULD LIKE
A WORD WITH YOU.
我们“外星人”想要
跟你说句话。

12:05.826 --> 12:09.296
* PEARL IS MY DAUGHTER,
I'LL SPIT IN YOUR EYE. *
* 珍珠是我的女儿，
我会吐你的眼睛。 *

12:09.329 --> 12:14.835
* OH, HO, PEARL'S A WHALE,
AND IT'S HER BIRTHDAY. *
*哦，HO，珍珠是鲸鱼，
今天是她的生日。 *

12:14.868 --> 12:16.136
TA-DAH!
达达！

12:16.169 --> 12:18.271
THANKS FOR THE SHOW, DAD.
谢谢你的演出，爸爸。

12:18.305 --> 12:20.240
NOW CAN WE OPEN THE PRESENTS?
现在我们可以打开礼物了吗？

12:20.273 --> 12:22.475
OH, ALL RIGHT.
哦，好吧。

12:22.509 --> 12:25.278
PRESENTS FOR ME DARLING
LITTLE SARDINE.
亲爱的，给我的礼物
小沙丁鱼。

12:25.312 --> 12:26.313
THERE YOU ARE.
你就在那里。

12:26.346 --> 12:28.015
OH, YOU
SHOULDN'T HAVE.
哦，你
不应该。

12:28.048 --> 12:29.449
WHAT IS IT, DADDY?
爸爸，这是什么？

12:29.482 --> 12:32.820
IT WOULDN'T BE THOSE
TOTALLY HIP NEW FLIPPER SLIPPERS
不会是那些
全新时尚拖鞋

12:32.853 --> 12:34.054
ALL MY FRIENDS WEAR.
我所有的朋友都穿。

12:34.087 --> 12:35.923
EVERYONE WANTS THEM.
每个人都想要它们。

12:35.956 --> 12:39.492
UH... UH... IT MIGHT BE.
呃……呃……可能是这样。

12:39.526 --> 12:42.062
WHEE! OH, YOU SHOULDN'T HAVE!
哇！哦，你不应该这样做！

12:42.095 --> 12:44.097
YAY, YOU SHOULDN'T HAVE!
是的，你不应该这样做！

12:44.131 --> 12:47.200
( angrily ):
I MEAN, DAD, YOU REALLY
SHOULDN'T HAVE.
（愤怒地）：
我的意思是，爸爸，你真的
不应该。

12:47.234 --> 12:49.136
( friends laughing )
（朋友笑）

12:49.169 --> 12:52.940
PEARL, THOSE ARE THE FINEST
FISHING BOOTS AVAILABLE.
珍珠，那些是最好的
提供钓鱼靴。

12:52.973 --> 12:55.075
DAD, YOU RUINED ME.
爸爸，你毁了我。

12:55.108 --> 12:56.309
( wailing )
（哀号）

12:56.343 --> 12:59.412
BUT I GOT THEM FOR A BARGAIN.
但我是讨价还价买的。

12:59.446 --> 13:03.183
( Pearl wailing )
（珍珠哀嚎）

13:05.185 --> 13:06.353
OH, WHAT AM I GOING TO DO?
哦，我该怎么办？

13:06.386 --> 13:08.822
I SPENT TWO WHOLE DOLLARS
ON THESE BOOTS
我花了整整两美元
在这双靴子上

13:08.856 --> 13:10.257
AND NOW I'M STUCK WITH THEM.
现在我被他们困住了。

13:10.290 --> 13:12.826
OH, UH, MR. KRABS,
CAN I GET MY PAYCHECK?
哦，呃，先生。螃蟹，
我可以拿到工资吗？

13:12.860 --> 13:15.062
SPONGEBOY-ME-BOB!
海绵宝宝我鲍勃！

13:15.095 --> 13:17.397
COME IN, COME IN,
RIGHT THIS WAY, LADDIE.
进来，进来，
这边走，莱迪。

13:17.430 --> 13:19.566
HAVE A SEAT ANYWHERE
随时随地都有座位

13:19.599 --> 13:24.304
BUT NOT ON
THESE BEAUTIFUL,
PRICELESS BOOTS.
但没有开启
这些美丽的，
无价的靴子。

13:27.007 --> 13:28.041
SO YOU WANT YOUR PAY.
所以你想要你的报酬。

13:28.075 --> 13:29.542
UH, SIR, I CAN'T SEE YOU.
呃，先生，我看不到你。

13:29.576 --> 13:31.511
THE BOOTS... ARE IN...
THE WAY.
靴子...在...
方式。

13:32.946 --> 13:34.047
IN THE WAY?
有碍吗？

13:34.081 --> 13:36.283
THESE BOOTS NEVER LEAVE
MY SIGHT.
这些靴子永远不会离开
我的视线。

13:36.316 --> 13:39.987
THEY'RE THE MOST EXPENSIVE
AND PRIZED POSSESSIONS I OWN.
它们是最贵的
以及我拥有的珍贵财产。

13:40.020 --> 13:41.488
WOW, REALLY?
WHY IS THAT?
哇，真的吗？
这是为什么？

13:41.521 --> 13:44.191
THEY LOOK JUST LIKE
ANY OLD ORDINARY BOOTS.
它们看起来很像
任何旧的普通靴子。

13:44.224 --> 13:45.959
ORDINARY BOOTS?!
普通靴子？！

13:45.993 --> 13:49.897
THESE ARE THE ONLY OFFICIAL
FRY COOK BOOTS.
这些是唯一的官方
炒厨师靴。

13:49.930 --> 13:53.033
ONLY THE FINEST
FRY COOKS IN
THE WORLD
只做最好的
煎煮
世界

13:53.066 --> 13:54.167
ARE PERMITTED
TO WEAR THEM--
允许
佩戴它们——

13:54.201 --> 13:55.568
PART OF A TRADITION.
传统的一部分。

13:55.602 --> 13:58.005
AND THESE BOOTS WERE GIVEN TO ME
这些靴子是给我的

13:58.038 --> 14:01.141
BY THE MOST FAMOUS FRY COOK
IN THE SEA.
由最著名的油炸厨师烹制
在海里。

14:01.174 --> 14:02.042
WHO WAS THAT?
那是谁？

14:02.075 --> 14:03.276
UH... UH...
呃……呃……

14:03.310 --> 14:05.578
UH... WELL, HIS NAME IS
NOT IMPORTANT.
呃...好吧，他的名字是
不重要。

14:05.612 --> 14:08.381
BUT HE WAS FAMOUS ALL RIGHT,
DON'T YOU WORRY.
但他确实很有名，
别担心。

14:08.415 --> 14:11.584
* I'M READY, I'M READY,
I WANT THOSE BOOTS! *
* 我准备好了，我准备好了，
我想要那些靴子！ *

14:11.618 --> 14:15.322
SORRY, SON, THESE BOOTS ARE
FAR TOO VALUABLE.
对不起，儿子，这些靴子是
太有价值了。

14:15.355 --> 14:17.257
HMM... I KNOW.
嗯...我知道。

14:17.290 --> 14:19.927
WHAT IF I GIVE YOU
MY KRUSTY KRAB PAYCHECK?
如果我给你呢
我的蟹堡王工资？

14:19.960 --> 14:21.394
PAYCHECK!
薪水！

14:21.428 --> 14:22.896
YOU GOT A DEAL!
成交了！

14:22.930 --> 14:25.165
AND WHAT IF I PAINT
THE KRUSTY KRAB FOR FREE?
如果我画画怎么办
脆皮蟹是免费的吗？

14:25.198 --> 14:26.133
YOU GOT A DEAL!
成交了！

14:26.166 --> 14:27.200
AND I'LL THROW IN
我会投入

14:27.234 --> 14:28.101
A YEAR'S SUPPLY
OF FRENCH FRY OIL.
一年的供应量
炸薯条油。

14:28.135 --> 14:28.969
YOU GOT...
你有...

14:29.002 --> 14:30.137
HOLD ON THERE
坚持住

14:30.170 --> 14:32.339
YOU'RE GOING TO GIVE ME
A HEART ATTACK.
你要给我
心脏病发作。

14:32.372 --> 14:36.509
WHOA... YOU GOT
YOURSELF A DEAL.
哇...你得到了
自己做交易。

14:38.946 --> 14:40.613
( blowing )
（吹）

14:40.647 --> 14:42.482
( squeaking )
（吱吱声）

14:42.515 --> 14:46.119
( squeaking continues )
（吱吱声继续）

14:46.153 --> 14:48.255
UH...
呃……

14:49.322 --> 14:50.457
HEY, SQUIDWARD...
嘿，章鱼哥……

14:51.458 --> 14:53.160
( boots squeaking )
（靴子吱吱作响）

14:53.193 --> 14:54.527
DO YOU LIKE MY NEW BOOTS?
你喜欢我的新靴子吗？

14:56.029 --> 14:57.164
PRETTY COOL, HUH?
很酷吧？

14:57.197 --> 14:58.999
NOW I'M AN OFFICIAL FRY COOK.
现在我是一名正式的油炸厨师。

14:59.032 --> 15:00.467
UH...
呃……

15:00.500 --> 15:10.543
( boots squeaking )
（靴子吱吱作响）

15:10.543 --> 15:15.648
( boots squeaking )
（靴子吱吱作响）

15:15.682 --> 15:17.550
( groaning )
（呻吟）

15:17.584 --> 15:21.688
THAT SQUEAKING IS GOING
TO DRIVE US ALL CRAZY!
吱吱声即将消失
让我们都疯狂！

15:21.721 --> 15:23.390
NONSENSE, SQUIDWARD.
废话，章鱼哥。

15:23.423 --> 15:27.594
THAT SQUEAKING IS MONEY
TO MY EARS... I MEAN MUSIC.
那吱吱声就是金钱
在我看来……我指的是音乐。

15:30.697 --> 15:34.567
AH... MONEY, MONEY, MONEY,
MONEY, MONEY.
啊...钱，钱，钱，
钱，钱。

15:34.601 --> 15:37.670
TEN, 20, 30, 40...
十、二十、三十、四十……

15:37.704 --> 15:39.139
( squeaking )
（吱吱声）

15:39.172 --> 15:40.307
WHA... WHO'S THERE?
什...谁在那儿？

15:41.541 --> 15:43.543
( chuckles )
（笑声）

15:44.544 --> 15:46.479
BACK TO COUNTING ME MONEY.
回到数我的钱。

15:46.513 --> 15:47.480
( register dings )
（登记叮当声）

15:47.514 --> 15:51.351
ONE, TWO, THREE, FOUR, FIVE...
一、二、三、四、五……

15:51.384 --> 15:52.652
( squeaking )
（吱吱声）

15:52.685 --> 15:55.422
WHAT THE BARNACLE IS THAT, HUH?
那是什么藤壶，嗯？

15:55.455 --> 15:56.523
( hinge squeaks )
（铰链吱吱作响）

15:56.556 --> 15:57.557
AH...
啊...

16:09.436 --> 16:11.071
( cries out )
（大声喊叫）

16:11.104 --> 16:12.405
( yelling )
（大喊）

16:12.439 --> 16:14.541
( splashes )
（溅起）

16:16.143 --> 16:18.145
( footsteps approaching )
（脚步声靠近）

16:20.113 --> 16:21.448
ARGH... OOP...
哎呀……哎呀……

16:22.682 --> 16:23.683
CAREFUL.
小心。

16:28.255 --> 16:29.222
( grunts )
（咕哝声）

16:29.256 --> 16:33.160
( grunting )
（咕哝）

16:33.193 --> 16:34.694
( sighs )
（叹气）

16:36.363 --> 16:37.597
( grunts )
（咕哝声）

16:39.532 --> 16:41.301
( yawning )
（打哈欠）

16:41.334 --> 16:43.070
( cries out )
（大声喊叫）

16:43.103 --> 16:44.071
( yelling )
（大喊）

16:44.104 --> 16:47.174
( squeaks )
（吱吱声）

16:47.207 --> 16:50.277
( moaning, hinge squeaking )
（呻吟声，铰链吱吱作响）

16:52.312 --> 16:56.516
ARGH... THAT WAS THE WORST NIGHT
I EVER WEATHERED.
啊……那是最糟糕的一晚
我曾经经历过。

16:56.549 --> 16:59.619
AT LEAST I'LL HAVE
SOME PEACE AND QUIET AT WORK.
至少我会有
工作中保持平静。

16:59.652 --> 17:01.254
WATCH IT, MR. KRABS.
注意，先生。螃蟹。

17:01.288 --> 17:03.256
I'M TAKING
MY VACATION NOW.
我正在服用
我现在放假了。

17:03.290 --> 17:05.658
WHAT'S WRONG, MR. SQUIDWARD?
WHAT'S WRONG, MR.章鱼哥？

17:05.692 --> 17:10.097
I CAN'T TAKE THE WORLD'S
GREATEST FRY COOK ANYMORE!
我无法接受世界的
最棒的炒菜厨师！

17:10.130 --> 17:12.065
I'LL SEE YOU IN A WEEK.
一周后见。

17:12.099 --> 17:13.833
THAT FRY COOK
那个油炸厨师

17:13.866 --> 17:15.235
IS MAKING ME
A FORTUNE.
让我
一笔财富。

17:15.268 --> 17:16.469
WHAT COULD BE
THE PROBLEM?
可能是什么
问题是什么？

17:16.503 --> 17:17.637
HEY, MR. KRABS.
嘿，先生。螃蟹。

17:17.670 --> 17:20.273
SPONGEBOB... BOB.. BOB... BOB...
海绵宝宝...鲍勃..鲍勃...鲍勃...

17:20.307 --> 17:21.274
( squeaking )
（吱吱声）

17:21.308 --> 17:22.475
BOB... BOB... BOB...
鲍勃...鲍勃...鲍勃...

17:22.509 --> 17:25.378
( boots squeaking )
（靴子吱吱作响）

17:25.412 --> 17:28.381
I, UH, SEE YOU'RE STILL
WEARING THEM BOOTS.
我，呃，看到你还在
穿着靴子。

17:28.415 --> 17:29.416
ARE YOU KIDDING?
你在开玩笑吧？

17:29.449 --> 17:30.650
I LOVE THEM!
我爱他们！

17:30.683 --> 17:33.486
COULD THE WORLD'S
GREATEST FRY COOK DO THIS?
世界上可以吗
最伟大的炒菜厨师会这样做吗？

17:33.520 --> 17:36.556
( squeaking )
（吱吱声）

17:37.757 --> 17:40.327
WELL, UH, I DON'T, UH...
I DON'T, UH...
嗯，呃，我不，呃……
我不，呃...

17:40.360 --> 17:41.661
OR COULD HE DO THIS?
或者他可以这样做吗？

17:42.462 --> 17:44.264
OR THIS?
还是这个？

17:45.465 --> 17:47.134
AND WATCH THIS,
MR. KRABS.
并观看这个，
先生。螃蟹。

17:47.167 --> 17:48.701
Boots ( squeaking ):
CAN I TAKE
靴子（吱吱作响）：
我可以带吗

17:48.735 --> 17:50.403
YOUR ORDER?
您的订单？

17:50.437 --> 17:51.671
YEAH, I'LL HAVE
THE KRUSTY SPECIAL.
是的，我会有
库斯蒂特别版。

17:51.704 --> 17:53.240
Boots ( squeaking ):
THANK YOU, SIR.
靴子（吱吱作响）：
谢谢您，先生。

17:53.273 --> 17:55.775
WE WILL SQUEAK
WHEN IT'S READY.
我们会尖叫
当它准备好时。

17:55.808 --> 17:58.411
COULD THE GREATEST FRY COOK DO
THAT, MR. KRABS?
最棒的油炸厨师能做什么
那，先生。螃蟹？

17:58.445 --> 18:00.613
I, UH...
我，呃…

18:00.647 --> 18:02.182
AND LOOK AT THIS,
MR. KRABS.
看看这个，
先生。螃蟹。

18:04.884 --> 18:06.586
AND THIS.
还有这个。

18:06.619 --> 18:07.754
AND THIS...
还有这个...

18:07.787 --> 18:09.856
AND THIS... AND THIS...
AND THIS...
还有这个...还有这个...
还有这个...

18:09.889 --> 18:11.524
AND THIS... AND THIS...
还有这个...还有这个...

18:11.558 --> 18:14.461
AND THIS... AND THIS...
AND THIS... AND THIS...
还有这个...还有这个...
还有这个...还有这个...

18:14.494 --> 18:16.396
( screaming )
（尖叫）

18:16.429 --> 18:17.797
I GOT TO GO TO MY OFFICE!
我得去我的办公室！

18:17.830 --> 18:21.434
( boots continue squeaking )
（靴子继续吱吱作响）

18:21.468 --> 18:22.902
I CAN STILL HEAR IT!
我还能听到！

18:22.935 --> 18:25.572
( squeaking continues )
（吱吱声继续）

18:25.605 --> 18:27.640
IT'S STILL COMING THROUGH!
它仍在发生！

18:27.674 --> 18:30.710
THE INFERNAL SQUEAK!
地狱般的吱吱声！

18:30.743 --> 18:33.413
THOSE BOOTS HAVE GOT TO GO!
这些靴子必须脱掉！

18:33.446 --> 18:36.749
AND I NEED AN ASPIRIN.
我需要一片阿司匹林。

18:38.851 --> 18:40.920
SpongeBob:
GARY, THESE BOOTS
海绵宝宝：
加里，这些靴子

18:40.953 --> 18:42.222
HAVE CHANGED MY LIFE.
改变了我的生活。

18:42.255 --> 18:43.756
I'M NEVER TAKING THEM OFF.
我永远不会把它们脱下来。

18:43.790 --> 18:44.824
( meows )
（喵）

18:44.857 --> 18:46.293
GOOD NIGHT, GARY.
晚安，加里。

18:46.326 --> 18:47.427
( squeaking )
（吱吱声）

18:47.460 --> 18:50.563
( snoring )
（打鼾）

19:03.476 --> 19:05.512
( snoring squeakily )
（鼾声如雷）

19:08.815 --> 19:12.819
( laughing ):
AR, AR, AR, AR, AR, AR...
（笑）：
增强现实、增强现实、增强现实、增强现实、增强现实……

19:12.852 --> 19:14.554
( hammering )
（锤击）

19:14.587 --> 19:17.190
( rooster crows )
（公鸡打鸣）

19:17.224 --> 19:20.427
Krabs:
AH... QUIET MONEY.
螃蟹：
啊……安静的钱。

19:20.460 --> 19:21.894
( sniffs )
（嗅）

19:21.928 --> 19:23.830
SILENCE AND MONEY.
沉默和金钱。

19:23.863 --> 19:24.897
( door opens )
（门打开）

19:24.931 --> 19:26.333
MR. KRABS!
先生。螃蟹！

19:26.366 --> 19:27.834
WHAT IS IT, MY BOY?
这是什么，我的孩子？

19:27.867 --> 19:33.373
( quavering ):
OH, MR. KRABS, I'M SORRY,
SORRY, SORRY, I'M SORRY.
（颤抖）：
哦，先生。蟹蟹，对不起，
对不起，对不起，对不起。

19:33.406 --> 19:35.208
IT'S OKAY, SON.
没关系，儿子。

19:35.242 --> 19:36.509
( wailing )
（哀号）

19:36.543 --> 19:38.578
NO, IT'S NOT OKAY!
不，这不行！

19:38.611 --> 19:42.315
I LOST THE BOOTS,
YOUR VALUABLE BOOTS.
我丢了靴子，
您宝贵的靴子。

19:42.349 --> 19:43.450
IT'S MY FAULT.
这是我的错。

19:43.483 --> 19:44.917
I LET YOU DOWN!
我让你失望了！

19:44.951 --> 19:47.420
( bawling ):
OH, I'M SORRY,
I'M SORRY...
（大哭）：
哦，对不起，
对不起...

19:47.454 --> 19:50.590
OOH, SORRY, SORRY,
SORRY, SORRY.
哦，对不起，对不起，
对不起，对不起。

19:50.623 --> 19:53.260
HOLD IT, BOY, IT'S NOT
THE END OF THE WORLD.
坚持住，孩子，这不是
世界末日。

19:53.293 --> 19:55.428
YES, IT IS.
是的。

19:55.462 --> 19:56.963
LOOK, DON'T CRY.
看，别哭。

19:56.996 --> 19:59.366
I'VE GOT SOME, UH...
我有一些，呃...

19:59.399 --> 20:00.867
SOME MAGIC OVEN MITTS.
一些魔法烤箱手套。

20:02.502 --> 20:03.836
( pop )
（ 流行音乐 ）

20:03.870 --> 20:04.937
( pop )
（ 流行音乐 ）

20:04.971 --> 20:07.574
THEY'RE NOT THE SAME!
它们不一样！

20:07.607 --> 20:11.744
YOU WERE RIGHT-- I WASN'T READY
FOR THOSE BLESSED BOOTS.
你是对的——我还没准备好
对于那些有福的靴子。

20:11.778 --> 20:12.779
( thud )
（砰）

20:14.281 --> 20:16.583
POOR LAD.
可怜的小伙子。

20:16.616 --> 20:18.851
( sizzling )
（铁板）

20:18.885 --> 20:20.387
EXCUSE ME.
打扰一下。

20:20.420 --> 20:21.388
I DIDN'T DO IT!
我没有这么做！

20:21.421 --> 20:22.589
OH...
哦...

20:22.622 --> 20:23.590
( chuckles nervously )
（紧张地笑）

20:23.623 --> 20:24.657
COULD I HELP YOU?
我可以帮助您吗？

20:24.691 --> 20:26.459
YEAH, I'M READY TO ORDER.
是的，我准备好订购了。

20:26.493 --> 20:27.727
WHAT'LL YOU HAVE?
你会得到什么？

20:27.760 --> 20:29.696
I'LL TAKE A ( squeaks ).
我要拿一个（吱吱声）。

20:29.729 --> 20:31.798
WHAT DID YOU SAY?
你说什么？

20:31.831 --> 20:34.334
I SAID I'LL TAKE A ( squeaks ).
我说我要拿一个（吱吱声）。

20:34.367 --> 20:35.868
HUH?!
啊？！

20:35.902 --> 20:37.704
I HEARD HIS ORDER, MR. KRABS.
我听到了他的命令，先生。螃蟹。

20:37.737 --> 20:39.906
HE SAID HE WANTS ( squeaks ).
他说他想要（吱吱声）。

20:39.939 --> 20:43.276
AND A ( squeaks )
AND A（吱吱声）

20:43.310 --> 20:45.545
( squeaking )
（吱吱声）

20:45.578 --> 20:46.646
( gasps )
（喘气）

20:46.679 --> 20:47.447
( squeaking )
（吱吱声）

20:47.480 --> 20:48.348
WHAT?!
什么？！

20:48.381 --> 20:49.516
( squeaking )
（吱吱声）

20:49.549 --> 20:50.683
( gasps )
（喘气）

20:50.717 --> 20:53.520
( ticking squeakily )
（吱吱作响）

20:53.553 --> 20:54.587
WHAT?!
什么？！

20:54.621 --> 20:55.722
( squeaking )
（吱吱声）

20:55.755 --> 20:57.390
I DIDN'T WRITE THAT!
那不是我写的！

20:57.424 --> 20:59.326
( squeaking getting louder )
（吱吱声越来越大）

20:59.359 --> 20:59.992
( thunder crashes )
（雷声轰鸣）

21:00.026 --> 21:01.761
( squeaking )
（吱吱声）

21:01.794 --> 21:02.629
( gasps )
（喘气）

21:02.662 --> 21:03.496
( squeaking )
（吱吱声）

21:03.530 --> 21:04.897
WHO SAID THAT?
谁说的？

21:06.566 --> 21:07.700
WHAT?!
什么？！

21:07.734 --> 21:09.135
( thunder crashes )
（雷声轰鸣）

21:09.168 --> 21:11.971
SpongeBob:
COULD THE WORLD'S GREATEST
FRY COOK DO THIS?
海绵宝宝：
世界上最伟大的
炒菜做饭吗？

21:12.004 --> 21:17.310
AND THIS... AND THIS...
AND THIS... AND THIS...
还有这个...还有这个...
还有这个...还有这个...

21:17.344 --> 21:18.645
AND THIS... AND THIS...
还有这个...还有这个...

21:18.678 --> 21:19.512
STOP IT!
停下来！

21:19.546 --> 21:21.981
STOP IT!!
停下来！！

21:22.014 --> 21:23.483
DON'T YOU HEAR IT?!
你没听到吗？

21:25.084 --> 21:26.553
YES, I DID IT!
I DID IT!
是的，我做到了！
我做到了！

21:26.586 --> 21:28.054
I TOOK THE BOOTS!
我拿走了靴子！

21:28.087 --> 21:29.789
THEY'RE HERE...
他们在这里...

21:29.822 --> 21:31.758
UNDER THE FLOORBOARD!
在地板下！

21:31.791 --> 21:33.793
OH, PLEASE, MAKE IT STOP!
哦，拜托，别这样了！

21:33.826 --> 21:36.996
IT'S THE SQUEAKING
OF THE HIDEOUS BOOTS!
这是吱吱声
丑陋的靴子！

21:37.029 --> 21:39.766
( bawling )
（嚎啕大哭）

21:39.799 --> 21:44.036
I'M SORRY, BUT I CAN'T TAKE
THE INFERNAL SQUEAKING NO MORE!
对不起，但我不能接受
地狱不再吱吱叫！

21:56.783 --> 21:57.917
( belches )
（打嗝）

21:57.950 --> 21:59.452
THE DEED IS DONE.
契约已经完成。

21:59.486 --> 22:02.555
UM... WHY DID YOU EAT
MY BOOTS, MR. KRABS?
嗯...你为什么吃东西
我的靴子，先生。螃蟹？

22:02.589 --> 22:04.657
BECAUSE, LAD, YOU
DIDN'T NEED THEM.
因为，小伙子，你
不需要它们。

22:04.691 --> 22:07.927
IT'S NOT THE BOOTS,
IT'S THE BOOTEE, UH...
这不是靴子，
这是Bootee，呃...

22:07.960 --> 22:10.630
I MEAN THE PERSON
IN THE BOOTS.
我指的是这个人
穿着靴子。

22:10.663 --> 22:12.632
YOU'RE A GREAT FRY COOK.
你是一位出色的油炸厨师。

22:12.665 --> 22:14.033
YOU REALLY THINK SO, MR. KRABS?
您真的这么认为，先生。螃蟹？

22:14.066 --> 22:15.067
I DO, SON.
我愿意，儿子。

22:15.101 --> 22:16.703
HERE'S YOUR PAYCHECK
I OWE YOU
这是你的薪水
我欠你

22:16.736 --> 22:18.638
PLUS A BONUS.
还有奖金。

22:20.106 --> 22:23.776
WELL, THERE'S YOUR
PAYCHECK ANYWAY.
好吧，这是你的
无论如何都要付薪水。

22:23.810 --> 22:25.612
I NEED A VACATION.
我需要一个假期。

22:25.645 --> 22:27.580
BYE, MR. KRABS.
再见，先生。螃蟹。

22:27.614 --> 22:31.718
Krabs:
AH... A LONG WEEK AWAY
FROM BIKINI BOTTOM
螃蟹：
啊...还有很长的一周
从比基尼下装

22:31.751 --> 22:33.586
IS EXACTLY WHAT I NEED.
正是我需要的。

22:33.620 --> 22:37.390
JUST ME AND MY DARLING
DAUGHTER PEARL.
只有我和我亲爱的
女儿珍珠。

22:37.424 --> 22:40.393
OH, DON'T FORGET MY NEW
FLIPPER SLIPPERS, DADDY.
哦，别忘了我的新
拖鞋，爸爸。

22:40.427 --> 22:42.662
DARLING, I WON'T.
亲爱的，我不会。

22:42.695 --> 22:44.964
( laughing )
（笑）

22:44.997 --> 22:46.933
( hiccups, squeaks )
（打嗝、吱吱声）

22:46.966 --> 22:48.167
OH, NO!
哦，不！

22:48.200 --> 22:54.006
( hiccuping, squeaking )
（打嗝、吱吱声）

22:56.008 --> 22:59.779
